WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,520 --> 00:00:03,320
Brother, where are you going?

2
00:00:03,320 --> 00:00:04,320
Take me with you

3
00:00:04,320 --> 00:00:06,120
Go to Minghu to clear your losses

4
00:00:06,120 --> 00:00:07,520
Who is going to take a bath?

5
00:00:07,520 --> 00:00:08,720
Just to take a bath

6
00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:11,120
At least hundreds of them were lost over at Minghu Lake.

7
00:00:11,120 --> 00:00:13,320
Brother, I haven’t washed in three days

8
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:14,520
Just make do with it

9
00:00:14,520 --> 00:00:15,720
Senior sister will also go

10
00:00:16,920 --> 00:00:19,100
Crazy

11
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:21,500
Don't wait until night to take a bath, even with your life.

12
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:22,500
They can only wash it

13
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:23,700
Let's go secretly again

14
00:00:23,700 --> 00:00:39,040
They all think we are crazy

15
00:00:39,040 --> 00:00:41,070
I risk my life just to take a bath

16
00:00:41,070 --> 00:00:42,070
What do you think?

17
00:00:42,070 --> 00:00:44,930
Very exciting

18
00:00:44,930 --> 00:00:47,770
Just exciting
